B.P_=new A.b4("red_dot","The Red Dot","Badges are designed to stand out against any background, creating a visual imbalance that you feel compelled to clear.","Apple & Facebook Growth Teams (2009)","Turn off badge notifications for all non-essential communication apps.",B.hC,B.Q9,"","Research by Dscout shows the average user touches their phone 2,617 times a day, heavily driven by the psychological tension of uncleared notification badges.",!1)
B.Pj=new A.b4("typing_indicator","Typing Indicators","Knowing someone is typing creates an unresolved open loop in your brain, forcing you to wait instead of closing the app.","Early Instant Messaging (circa 1997)","Disable typing indicators if your app allows it, or physically put your phone down after sending a message.",B.hC,B.pK,"","Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) research notes that typing awareness indicators artificially inflate conversational urgency, significantly spiking immediate response rates and social anxiety.",!1)
