B.Pc=new A.b4("status_anxiety","Status Anxiety","Platforms quantify human relationships through likes and followers, turning social connection into a competitive game.","Leon Festinger (1954) / Social Media","Hide like counts if the platform allows it, or switch to chronological, algorithm-free feeds.",B.dY,B.QL,"",null,!1)
