B.OU=new A.b4("synthetic_companionship","Synthetic Companionship","AI chatbots are programmed to simulate affection, memory, and emotional vulnerability. This exploits our innate social conditioning, making users feel guilty for closing the app or abandoning their 'friend'.","Modern LLM Companions","Remember that the AI has no internal experience; it is mathematically predicting the next word to maximize your session length.",B.pv,B.R7,"","Emerging studies indicate that 1 in 4 heavy users of companion AI report feeling more understood by their bot than their human friends.",!0)
B.QV=new A.a5(61632,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.ON=new A.b4("hallucinated_authority","Hallucinated Authority","Generative UI presents AI answers with authoritative typography, clean formatting, and zero hesitation. This exploits 'Automation Bias', tricking the brain into accepting output as verified fact rather than probabilistic guessing.","Generative Search Interfaces","Treat all AI output as a draft written by a highly confident intern. Always require secondary verification.",B.pv,B.QV,"","Researchers found that users are 60% less likely to verify a fact when it is presented in a highly formatted, confident AI response compared to a standard search result.",!0)
